[{"code":"G-hweb2-0185","no":1,"set":"essay","sub":"Ⅲ-B","subname":"헤스 법칙","type":"헤스 법칙으로 반응 엔탈피 구하기","ans":"<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>95.4</mn></math> kJ","lv":"중","fam":"hw185","q":"<div class=\"q\" id=\"q-bkghweb20185\"><div class=\"qh\"><b class=\"qn\">1</b><span class=\"qp\">[3점]</span></div><div class=\"qs\"><p>다음은 암모니아(NH<sub>3</sub>)의 생성과 관련된 열화학 반응식이다.</p><div class=\"hwbox\"><p>(가) N<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + 3H<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) → 2NH<sub>3</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>), <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>92.2</mn></math> kJ</p><p>(나) N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + H<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) → 2NH<sub>3</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>), <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>187.6</mn></math> kJ</p></div><p>이 열화학 반응식을 이용하여 다음 반응의 반응 엔탈피(<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi></math>)를 구하는 과정을 서술하시오.</p><div class=\"hwbox\"><p>N<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + 2H<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) → N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>), <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo></math>?</p></div></div></div>","exp":"<div class=\"sol\" id=\"s-bkghweb20185\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sn\">1</span><span class=\"sa\">정답 <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>95.4</mn></math> kJ</span><span class=\"sc2\">G-hweb2-0185</span></div><div class=\"ss\">출처 : 해원고 부교재 3-2 수준별 평가 185번 (원본)</div><p><span class=\"lb\">풀이</span></p><p class=\"st\">목표 반응에서 N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>)는 생성물이므로 (나)를 뒤집는다: 2NH<sub>3</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) → N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + H<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>), <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>187.6</mn></math> kJ</p><p class=\"st\">(가) + (나)의 역반응: N<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + 3H<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + 2NH<sub>3</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) → 2NH<sub>3</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + H<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>)</p><p class=\"st\">양쪽의 2NH<sub>3</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>)와 H<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) 1 몰을 지우면 N<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) + 2H<sub>2</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>) → N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>(<span class=\"mx\">𝑔</span>)</p><p class=\"st\"><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>92.2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>187.6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>95.4</mn></math> kJ</p><div class=\"rv\"><span class=\"lb\">이 문제를 틀렸다면 다시 공부할 부분</span><div class=\"st\">→ 헤스 법칙의 적용 <span class=\"sm\">(개념 정리 Ⅲ-B 2)</span></div></div></div>","hw":"o","ono":185}]